  "remarks": "Joint Stock Company “Pochta Bank” is a major Russian retail bank created as a joint venture between VTB Group and Russian Post. It has an extensive regional network based in post offices. The Central Bank of Russia has officialy included Joint Stock Company “Pochta Bank” in the list of most important banks on the payment services market. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC “Pochta Bank” is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
